# WinServeAI

Windows-native **llama.cpp appliance wrapper**. Not a multi-backend platform.

```text
App → ServerManager → runtime/llama + process → bin/llama-server.exe → /v1
```

## Hard rules

- One backend: llama.cpp only
- One orchestrator: `ServerManager`
- Raw llama flags only in `app/src/runtime/llama.rs`
- No backend traits, plugins, or provider abstractions
- No model downloads, chat UI, Docker
- YAML config is source of truth (`config/default.yaml`)

## Logs

`logs/server.log`, `logs/llama.log`, `logs/error.log` — capture stdout, stderr, exit codes.
